{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"ab6bd09d846dcde6621fd2196e68664fc3521e8456f6a671d0fde80467e1bc69","digest":{"component_or_area":"agent guidance and tool integration","key_entities":["AGENTS.md",".claude/settings.json",".rebar/criteria_routing.json",".rebar/plan_review_moves.json","find_referencing_symbols","PreToolUse hook","Bash","grep","rg","monkeypatch.setattr","ENABLE_TOOL_SEARCH","env.ENABLE_TOOL_SEARCH"],"problem_keywords":["source code reference lookup","symbol resolution","grep vs serena","friction asymmetry","LSP blind spots","string literal references"],"propositions":["Agents prefer grep over Serena's symbol tools despite documentation, due to friction asymmetry (grep requires zero extra steps vs. deferred ToolSearch discovery for Serena)","Serena's LSP cannot resolve symbols referenced as string literals (e.g., monkeypatch.setattr, getattr, importlib patterns), so exclusive reliance on Serena misses these call sites","Serena's index can lag behind recent edits in the working tree, causing stale line numbers while grep reports the current tree","Documentation alone fails to enforce symbol-tool preference due to launch-time decay and lack of in-moment triggers or feedback at the point of action","The workflow must make the good default cheap and surface the tool choice at the moment of action via a non-blocking PreToolUse hook on Bash grep invocations"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787321458439243001,"uuid":"5f2829c3-6eca-4f5a-b9e7-3211356bfe14"}